%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial","lineColor":"#424242","actorBkg":"#F5F5F5","actorBorder":"#616161"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant Client as Web Client
    participant API as API Service
    participant DB as Database
    Staff->>Client: Submit action
    Client->>API: POST /resource
    API->>DB: Save data
    DB-->>API: Saved record
    alt Valid request
        API-->>Client: 201 Created
    else Invalid request
        API-->>Client: 400 Validation error
    end
    Client-->>Staff: Show result
